{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50111","headline":"游仙窟诗 游後园 · 张文成","name":"游仙窟诗 游後园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时过小苑，今朝戏後园。\n两岁梅花匝，三春柳色繁。\n水明鱼影静，林翠鸟歌喧。\n何须杏树岭，即是桃花源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文成","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}